\title "= ties the note on to the next one"
\ts (4 4)
5.3.4{txt "Tab view: press this 5, then =. The 7 after it turns (5), tied to it, and the two are written as one half note"}
  7.3.4 r.2 |
3.2.2{txt "Tab view: press this 3, then N, Shift+5 (a quarter) and =. A quarter (3) is tied on after it, writing over the next 0; = again ties on another"}
  0.2.4 0.2.4 |

